    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n134" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβολος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βολή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that has not shed his foal-teeth,</i> of a young horse,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				408
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				834c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				576b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.978
			</span></i>: also of an old horse, <i>that no longer sheds them,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				322
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβολα, τά,</span>
			<i>an unlucky throw</i> of the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.204
			</span></i>.</div>
